### Create a Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
    "title": "Design Figma Mockups",
    "description": "Create wireframes and interactive mockups for the homepage",
    "status": "TODO",
    "projectId": 1,
    "organizationId": 6,
    "affectedUserId": 5
}
###

### Get Task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/1?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### List Tasks by Project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/project/1?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### List Tasks by Organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/organization/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### List Tasks Assigned to a User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/user/5?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### Update Task (Status & Reassignment)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/1?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
    "title": "Design Figma Mockups - Approved",
    "description": "Mockups approved by stakeholders",
    "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
    "affectedUserId": 5
}
###

### Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/1?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
